  "notes": {
    "raw": "Phase changes: 692.73 K, melting point of Zn; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 1.750$ kcal/mol. 1180 K, boiling point of Zn; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 27.565$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">298.15-1300 K:</td><td> $Cp^o = 11.819 + 1.166x10^{-3}T - 1.067x10^5T^{-2}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $H^o - H_{298}^o = 11.819x10^{-3}T + 0.583x10^{-6}T^2 + 1.067x10^2T^{-1} - 3.934$ </td></tr></table>\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">298.15-692.73 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -62.884 + 2.549 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.969 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 85.150 T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -62.884 - 2.549 \\times 10^{-3} T \\ln T + 0.969 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 42.575 T^{-1} + 40.109 \\times 10^{-3} T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">692.73-1180 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -63.621 + 0.148 \\times 10^{-3} T + 0.423 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 72.550 T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -63.621 - 0.148 \\times 10^{-3} T \\ln T - 0.423 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 36.275 T^{-1} + 26.446 \\times 10^{-3} T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">1180-1300 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -94.174 + 2.679 \\times 10^{-3} T + 0.423 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 72.550 T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -94.174 - 2.679 \\times 10^{-3} T \\ln T - 0.423 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 36.275 T^{-1} + 70.247 \\times 10^{-3} T$ </td></tr></table>\nSources: Enthalpy of formation at 298 K from Adami (1). Low-temperature heat capacities and entropy at 298 K from Stuve (111). High-temperature data based on Pankratz (93). ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "Phase changes: 692.73 K, melting point of Zn; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 1.750$ kcal/mol. 1180 K, boiling point of Zn; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 27.565$ kcal/mol.",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">298.15-1300 K:</td><td> $Cp^o = 11.819 + 1.166x10^{-3}T - 1.067x10^5T^{-2}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $H^o - H_{298}^o = 11.819x10^{-3}T + 0.583x10^{-6}T^2 + 1.067x10^2T^{-1} - 3.934$ </td></tr></table>",
      "Reaction equations (kcal/mol):",
      "<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">298.15-692.73 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -62.884 + 2.549 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.969 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 85.150 T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -62.884 - 2.549 \\times 10^{-3} T \\ln T + 0.969 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 42.575 T^{-1} + 40.109 \\times 10^{-3} T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">692.73-1180 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -63.621 + 0.148 \\times 10^{-3} T + 0.423 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 72.550 T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -63.621 - 0.148 \\times 10^{-3} T \\ln T - 0.423 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 36.275 T^{-1} + 26.446 \\times 10^{-3} T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">1180-1300 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -94.174 + 2.679 \\times 10^{-3} T + 0.423 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 72.550 T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -94.174 - 2.679 \\times 10^{-3} T \\ln T - 0.423 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 36.275 T^{-1} + 70.247 \\times 10^{-3} T$ </td></tr></table>",
      "Sources: Enthalpy of formation at 298 K from Adami (1). Low-temperature heat capacities and entropy at 298 K from Stuve (111). High-temperature data based on Pankratz (93)."
